2026-10-15 12:16:16 BST | INFO     | NeuroSan:_log:821 - NeuroSan - {"message": "The Sample queries: ['I just uploaded a policy document. Ingest it, split it into pages, and tell me the total page count before we start review.', "What's the current status of document DOC-4821, how many pages are approved so far, and which classifier ruleset version is pinned to it?", "The operator approved page 2. Record that decision and give me the next page's side-by-side review — redacted vs. unredacted with highlights.", 'The reviewer added a missed phone number on page 4 and removed a false-positive email flag. Log both edits as structured feedback and show the current approval coverage.', 'Run the active-learning pass over the accumulated feedback and list any staged classifier proposals now sitting in the PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW queue.']", "user_id": "snigdhasahoo", "Timestamp": "2026-10-15T12:16:16.145370", "source": "HttpServer", "message_type": "Other", "request_id": "request-5"}
