e per-page side-by-side payload, suspend execution in `WAITING_FOR_HUMAN` (no auto-advance on timeout), and capture each explicit operator APPROVE/MODIFY/REJECT decision into the approval matrix keyed by `page_id`. MODIFY edits are routed downstream to my Feedback Logging Agent (ADD = missed detection, REMOVE = over-detection), which confirmed partial relevance and flagged a `write_file` allow-list failure that must be fixed before feedback records persist.'}
