2026-10-15 12:22:48 BST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:821 - nsflow - 2026-10-15 12:22:48 - generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network - INFO - {'otrace': ['orchestrator_supervisor_agent', 'ingestion_pagination_agent', 'classification_detection_agent', 'redaction_rendering_agent', 'hitl_gateway_agent', 'feedback_logging_agent', 'active_learning_agent'], 'text': 'result from master_classifier_repository_agent\n{\n  "Name": "Master Data Classifiers Ruleset Store",\n  "Inquiry": "Ingest the uploaded sample file, validate it, and split it into deterministic ordered page units with reproducible page_ids and page_hashes. [routing check: does any stage upstream/downstream handle file ingestion, validation, and page-unit splitting?]",\n  "Mode": "Determine",\n  "Relevant": "No",\n  "Strength": 8,\n  "Claim": "None",\n  "Requirements": "None"\n}\n\nRationale: This inquiry concerns **file ingestion, file validation, and deterministic page-unit segmentation** (page_ids / page_hashes). That is a document-preprocessing capability, entirely outside my scope.\n\nI am the governed system of record for the **pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset only**. My area of expertise is limited to:\n- PII/PHI category definitions and their hierarchy\n- Regex patterns per detectable span type\n- Named-entity types recognized by detectors\n- Confidence thresholds governing span flagging\n- Versioned, read-only serving of pinned ruleset revisions, plus the strictly-gated write path (valid Human Admin approval token, atomic versioned revisions, append-only history, PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW queue)\n\nNone of those cover reading a sample file, validating it, or splitting it into ordered page units — and a page-segmentation stage is not something I hold or serve. I therefore have no claim on this inquiry, and I am routing it back as out-of-scope rather than attempting it.\n\nIf instead you need any of the following, I am the correct agent and can serve them read-only (always returning the exact pinned revision identifier):\n- The active or a specific historical classifier ruleset version\n- Regex/entity/threshold definitions for a given span type\n- The PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW queue contents\n- Promotion of a queued change **only** upon presentation of a valid Human Admin approval token for that exact item'}
