.json` (also attempted under `redaction_feedback/` with create_parents).\n- Error: `invalid_input: \'allowed_paths\' is required and must be a non-empty list of paths.` This appears to be an operator-configured allowlist issue, not a transient fault; retried once with a different path and failed identically.\n- Since the record could not be confirmed persisted, I am reporting the failure rather than claiming success. No record was durably written; the routing determination above stands regardless.'}
