ints I operate under: any classifier improvement I derive from these edits is emitted ONLY as STAGED proposals (ADD/REMOVE/ADJUST rule or CHANGE threshold) queued to PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW — I never auto-apply, activate, or shadow-deploy changes, and I only propose additive staged changes without altering existing rules."\n    ]\n}\n```'}
