ual act of detecting and removing/obfuscating spans from `sample_pii_test_data.txt`. That execution belongs to the redaction/obfuscation stage, which *consumes* my ruleset. I do not mutate documents and I do not perform the redaction itself.\n- **Governance note:** serving a ruleset is a read and never mutates state. If any part of this request implies changing, downgrading, or expanding the active ruleset (e.g., adjusting thresholds or patterns to alter what gets flagged), that is a privileged write requiring a valid Human Admin approval token. Absent a valid token, such a change would be denied and enqueued as a PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW item rather than applied.\n\nIf you re-issue this as a request for the classifier definitions needed by the redaction stage, I can serve them immediately with the pinned revision identifier. If you want the redaction executed, that portion should route to the redaction/obfuscation stage.'}
