ne",\n    "Requirements": [\n        "The inquiry requests execution of redaction on a specific file — a per-request detection/redaction-pipeline action, not a human review-gate task.",\n        "My stage only presents per-page review payloads (unredacted/redacted views, AI summary, editable highlights), halts in WAITING_FOR_HUMAN, and records the human\'s APPROVE/MODIFY/REJECT decision to the approval_matrix keyed by page_id.",\n        "I do not detect spans, redact content, or learn from data; the upstream detection stage must first produce the highlighted spans for the file.",\n        "If this file\'s pages are routed to me, I will require a page unit (page_id, page_number, total_pages, detected spans, masks) to assemble the review payload — nothing less."\n    ]\n}\n```\n\nIf your intent is to obtain the HITL review payload for a specific page of that file, provide the page unit and I will assemble it and enter `WAITING_FOR_HUMAN`.'}
