t a gate (e.g., a reviewer adds a missed PII span, removes a false positive, or rejects a flagged span), route those edits to me and I will emit one structured record per edit and forward the accumulated feedback to the learning stage.\n\nThe redaction request itself should be routed to the redaction/obfuscation execution stage.'}
