d units are then routed here, I can fulfill my portion of the pipeline: per-page dual-state rendering (unredacted_view with category/classifier_id/confidence overlays + redacted_view with category-labeled masks), span diff, leakage/offset self-checks, per-page page_hash, and handoff to HITL review for APPROVE/MODIFY/REJECT.'}
