2026-10-15 13:52:48 BST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:821 - nsflow - 2026-10-15 13:52:48 - agent_network_designer - INFO - {'otrace': ['agent_network_designer', '/agent_network_editor', 'network_editor', 'get_subnetwork'], 'text': 'Got result:\n{"tool_end": true, "tool_error": false, "tool_output": {"/generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network": "\\nTop-level supervisor that owns and enforces the shared document state for the redaction and obfuscation pipeline. It drives the document through INGESTED, IN_PROGRESS, PENDING_FINAL_ENCODE, COMPLETED, or REJECTED; enforces one-page-in-flight and strict page-order sequencing; requires real human APPROVE or MODIFY per page before advancing (REJECT re-routes that page); pins the classifier ruleset version for the whole document; keeps an append-only audit log; and blocks any approval bypass. Invoke it to route pipeline stages, coordinate human-in-the-loop intercepts at page boundaries, track approval coverage, and gate final completion.\\n                "}}'}
