2026-10-15 13:53:46 BST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:821 - nsflow - 2026-10-15 13:53:46 - agent_network_designer - INFO - {'otrace': ['agent_network_designer', '/agent_network_editor'], 'text': 'Got result:\n{"tool_end": true, "tool_output": "Successfully created the structure of the agent network.\\n\\n**RedactionPipeline** network structure:\\n- **Ingestion & Validation Agent** (top/entry): \\u2192 Redaction Proposal, Classifier Repository/Governance, `read_file`\\n- **Classifier Repository / Governance Agent**: \\u2192 Redaction Proposal (supplies rules; receives proposals), Active Learning (suggestions), `/generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network` (Human Admin approval gate)\\n- **Redaction Proposal Agent**: \\u2192 Human Review Gate Coordinator, `openai_code_interpreter`\\n- **Human Review Gate Coordinator Agent**: \\u2192 Obfuscation/Hardening Engine, Active Learning (decision logs), `/generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network` (Human Operator review gate)\\n- **Obfuscation / Hardening Engine Agent**: \\u2192 `write_file` (irreversible final output)\\n- **Active Learning Agent**: terminal (aggregates decisions/suggestions)\\n\\nThe result is a single-rooted DAG enforcing the mandatory governance and human-approval gates, with the human interaction nodes delegated to the HITL subnetwork."}'}
2026-10-15 13:53:46 BST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:821 - nsflow - 2026-10-15 13:53:46 - agent_network_designer - INFO - {'otrace': ['agent_network_designer'], 'text': 'result from /agent_network_editor\nSuccessfully created the structure of the agent network.\n\n**RedactionPipeline** network structure:\n- **Ingestion & Validation Agent** (top/entry): → Redaction Proposal, Classifier Repository/Governance, `read_file`\n- **Classifier Repository / Governance Agent**: → Redaction Proposal (supplies rules; receives proposals), Active Learning (suggestions), `/generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network` (Human Admin approval gate)\n- **Redaction Proposal Agent**: → Human Review Gate Coordinator, `openai_code_interpreter`\n- **Human Review Gate Coordinator Agent**: → Obfuscation/Hardening Engine, Active Learning (decision logs), `/generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network` (Human Operator review gate)\n- **Obfuscation / Hardening Engine Agent**: → `write_file` (irreversible final output)\n- **Active Learning Agent**: terminal (aggregates decisions/suggestions)\n\nThe result is a single-rooted DAG enforcing the mandatory governance and human-approval gates, with the human interaction nodes delegated to the HITL subnetwork.'}
