oken is needed to ENQUEUE a proposal; registration requires the proposed change content plus origin (learning-pipeline-proposed) and submission time. Promotion into a pinned revision requires a valid Human Admin approval token referencing that exact queued item; otherwise fail-closed and stays pending.",\n        "Confirm the revision identifier of the active pinned ruleset to diff proposals against.",\n        "Note: per-document runtime redaction of /Users/snigdhasahoo/Auto_Redaction/data/sample_pii_test_data.txt is NOT my function — I run on batch/periodic trigger and only turn accumulated feedback into staged proposals; I never modify classifier behavior directly."\n    ]\n}'}
