er-page or pre-decision.",\n        "If a ruleset-touching write-change exists for this page_id, its PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW reference plus a valid Human Admin approval token (per the Master Data Classifiers Ruleset agent)."\n    ]\n}\n```\n\nI am not relevant to this pre-decision inquiry. No staged proposals or PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW registrations are produced from it. I will revisit the evidence only once human decisions/edits for this `page_id` have accumulated into the feedback buffer viable for aggregation.'}
