strictly downstream: once that gate produces per-edit outputs, forward each MODIFY/REJECT to me with page_id, change_type, classifier_id, category, context_snippet, span, confidence, reviewer_id, and timestamp so I can persist one structured record per edit and pass accumulated feedback to the learning stage. Neither I nor my down-chain learning agent performs gating or assessment (confirmed by Active Learning Agent and the Master Data Classifiers Ruleset System of Record)."\n    ]\n}\n```'}
