_id — I never fabricate, infer, or default an approval, and there is no auto-advance on timeout.",\n        "For MODIFY: the operator\'s editable_highlights with span details (ADD = missed detection/false negative; REMOVE = over-detection/false positive) so I can route each edit to the feedback pipeline.",\n        "I will emit the side-by-side payload, transition to WAITING_FOR_HUMAN, halt execution, then on decision record reviewer_id, timestamp, action, and spans_final into the approval_matrix keyed by page_id. Downstream (feedback logging stage) receives MODIFY/REJECT edits after the gate."\n    ]\n}\n```'}
