rward\n1. **Confirm the backend is repaired** (test it yourself: a plain `print(\"hello\")` must return usable text/bytes output). Once it does, say the word and I'll re-run ingestion immediately.\n2. **Stream the raw text directly** — the ingestion stage accepts a raw text stream, which bypasses the faulty interpreter. Paste the file contents and I'll produce the ordered `page_units` + `total_pages` right away.\n\nAs soon as ingestion succeeds I will: pin the ruleset version, establish the trip binding, set `current_page_index = 0`, and open the HITL review gate for **page 1** so a real operator can APPROVE / MODIFY / REJECT.\n\nWhich do you want — retry once the backend is fixed, or paste the raw contents now?"}
