MAIL]` |\n| 5 | 8–19 | PHONE_NUMBER | `[REDACTED_PHONE]` |\n| 7 | 21–32 | US_SSN | `[REDACTED_SSN]` |\n| 9 | 4–28 | STREET_ADDRESS | `[REDACTED_ADDRESS]` |\n| 12 | 10–19 | DATE_OF_BIRTH | `[REDACTED_DOB]` |\n| 12 | 25–36 | US_SSN | `[REDACTED_SSN]` |\n| 15 | 15–30 | CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER | `[REDACTED_CC]` |\n| 18 | 3–18 | BANK_ACCOUNT_NUMBER | `[REDACTED_ACCOUNT]` |\n| 22 | 9–22 | IPV4_ADDRESS | `[REDACTED_IP]` |\n| 25 | 11–27 | SECRET / API_KEY | `[REDACTED_SECRET]` |\n| 29 | 6–20 | PASSPORT_NUMBER | `[REDACTED_PASSPORT]` |\n| 31 | 4–19 | DRIVER_LICENSE | `[REDACTED_DL]` |\n| 34 | 7–22 | MEDICAL_RECORD_NUMBER | `[REDACTED_MRN]` |\n\nAdditional lower-confidence regions were resolved as duplicates/contained spans and are covered by the rows above.\n\n### Sample redacted excerpts\n\n```text\nLine 3:  Contact: [REDACTED_NAME], [REDACTED_EMAIL]\nLine 7:  SSN: [REDACTED_SSN]\nLine 12: DOB: [REDACTED_DOB]; SSN: [REDACTED_SSN]\nLine 15: Card: [REDACTED_CC]\nLine 25: api_key=[REDACTED_SECRET]\n```\n\n### Determination\n\nApply full-span replacement using typed tokens. Preserve surrounding punctuation, delimiters, and line structure. For `SECRET / API_KEY`, use full replacement and treat the original value as compromised. No headers, footers, or trailing lines require redaction.'}
