nt_page_index / page_units / total_pages:** undefined — no verified read exists.\n- **approval_matrix:** empty (nothing to approve yet).\n- **Discrepancy recorded:** `BLOCKED_TOOL_FAILURE` (ingestion backend) + `UNVERIFIED_ASSESSMENT` (classification stage unreachable, third-party summary unsourced).\n\nPer my rules, on a missing/conflicting record I **halt advancement and log the discrepancy rather than guess** — so nothing has been classified, redacted, or advanced, and no approval gate has been touched.\n\n## To move forward\n\n1. Restore the ingestion/pagination execution backend. Once it's up, re-submit unchanged — that stage is idempotent and will yield stable page IDs/hashes.\n2. Restore the classification/detection stage so the \"assess for redaction\" half can actually be serviced.\n\nOnce ingestion succeeds, I'll register the document, pin the ruleset version, establish the locked page order, and walk you through the per-page human review gates — no page advances without a real operator APPROVE/MODIFY. I can also report current status, `current_page_index`, approval coverage, and pinned ruleset version at any time on request."}
