2026-10-15 22:53:32 BST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:821 - nsflow - 2026-10-15 22:53:32 - generated/hitl_document_redaction_obfuscation_network - INFO - {'otrace': ['orchestrator_supervisor_agent'], 'text': 'result from agent\n**Determination: Yes** — this dataset is in scope for sensitive-span detection, classification, and redaction assessment.\n\nAs the redaction/obfuscation agent, I can process the described customer support & DSAR request log content and return a span-level redaction manifest covering:\n\n| Category | Examples I detect/classify | Typical redaction action |\n|---|---|---|\n| **PII** | Names, emails, phone numbers, addresses, DOB, account IDs, IPs, device IDs | Pseudonymize, mask, generalize |\n| **PHI** | Diagnoses, medications, treatment notes, insurance/member IDs, provider names | Redact, tokenize, date-shift |\n| **PCI** | Card PANs, CVV, expiration dates, bank account/routing numbers | Mask/tokenize, retain last 4 only |\n| **Credentials** | Passwords, API keys, tokens, session cookies, connection strings | Remove, vault-reference, replace with placeholder |\n| **Legal IDs** | SSNs, passport numbers, driver’s licenses, national/tax IDs | Tokenize, mask, redact |\n\n**Processing mode:** Determine  \n**Assessment result:** Redaction required; high-sensitivity mixed-content dataset.\n\nI can ingest uploaded/pasted text, JSON, CSV, or transcript-style content, normalize it, and run:\n- Pattern/checksum detection for PCI, SSN, tax IDs, passport/license formats\n- NER/context classification for PII and PHI in free-text support transcripts\n- Entropy and secret-pattern detection for credentials\n- Confidence scoring, character offsets, and suggested redaction actions\n\nExample output schema:\n\n```json\n{\n  "document_id": "dsar-log-test-001",\n  "assessment": "redaction_required",\n  "spans": [\n    {\n      "start": 142,\n      "end": 158,\n      "text_preview": "J*** D***",\n      "category": "PII",\n      "subcategory": "name",\n      "confidence": 0.98,\n      "action": "pseudonymize"\n    },\n    {\n      "start": 410,\n      "end": 429,\n      "text_preview": "4111-****-****-1111",\n      "category": "PCI",\n      "subcategory": "credit_card",\n      "confidence": 0.99,\n      "action": "mask_last4"\n    },\n    {\n      "start": 812,\n      "end": 845,\n      "text_preview": "diagnosis: ...",\n      "category": "PHI",\n      "subcategory": "diagnosis",\n      "confidence": 0.91,\n      "action": "redact"\n    },\n    {\n      "start": 1201,\n      "end": 1236,\n      "text_preview": "api_key=****",\n      "category": "credentials",\n      "subcategory": "api_key",\n      "confidence": 0.97,\n      "action": "remove"\n    }\n  ],\n  "hitl_review_required": true\n}\n```\n\nI can also produce the redacted document, redaction manifest, and audit trail. Upload/paste the content and I’ll return the classified sensitive spans with offsets and recommended redaction actions.'}
